; The browser library (design sections 11 and 13): the real DOM on Jv, the
; browser host, the listeners and Kilim_browser.run. It uses kilim, kilim.web
; and Brr only, and none of Printf, Format, Scanf, Str, Hashtbl, Random, Fun or
; Printexc. windtrap runs only native code, thus no instrumentation: the event
; rules are in Kilim.Private.Event, and test/dom/guards.txt lists the guards of
; this library with their tests.

(library
 (name kilim_browser)
 (public_name kilim.browser)
 (flags
  (:standard -w +50))
 (libraries kilim kilim.web brr))
